 unlock her computer with her fingerprint. This resulted in access to her Desktop Signal on her computer, revealing sources and their conversations.\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/news/articles/washington-post-raid-proves-face-153402560.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttps://www.yahoo.com/news/articles/washington-post-raid-pro...\u003c/a\u003e\u003cp\u003eEdit: I've a lot more details about the legality and precedence on the apps landing page \u003ca href=\"https://paniclock.github.io/\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttps://paniclock.github.io/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47807809\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47807809\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 244\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 109\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://github.com/paniclock/paniclock/","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47807809","date_published":"2026-04-17T16:38:44Z","author":{"name":"seanieb","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=seanieb"}},{"id":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47807619","title":"Hyperscalers have already outspent most famous US megaprojects","content_html":"\n\u003cp\u003eArticle URL: \u003ca href=\"https://twitter.com/finmoorhouse/status/2044933442236776794\"\u003ehttps://twitter.com/finmoorhouse/status/2044933442236776794\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47807619\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47807619\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 271\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 264\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://twitter.com/finmoorhouse/status/2044933442236776794","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47807619","date_published":"2026-04-17T16:23:22Z","author":{"name":"nowflux","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=nowflux"}}]}